  "title": "Vegetarian Zucchini Boats",
  "description": "These zucchini boats are stuffed with sweet tomatoes, garlic, bread crumbs, mozzarella, and Parmesan cheese for an easy and flavorful meal in under an hour.",
  "authors": [
    "Webb Sledge"
  ],
